=2 Walkthrough
* Go to your Temporary Key Items and **read** the {@k} {k:Hastily scribbled note}.
** It is located before your Phantom Gem Key Items, just after the not-so-temporary {k:Pristine hair ribbon}.
** Performing this step is required. You must actually do this in order to continue.
* Go to the **Waterfront** in {z:Western Adoulin}, {p:Waypoint} **#9** and examine the **Sunrise Beacon** (J-4) at the north end of the dock for a cutscene.
** If you have not opened the {@k} {k:Hastily scribbled note} in your Temporary Key Items, examining the **Sunrise Beacon** will produce the message "There is nothing out of the ordinary here."

